      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Monitor cooling with calibrated thermometers at the thickest part of the food and enforce strict visual inspections for signs like condensation pockets or slow-moving step-down temperatures. Red flags include any temperature plateaus where food stays above 70°F for too long, extended time between stages, or accidental delays due to equipment failure. If observed breaches occur, immediately discard the affected batch and retrain staff without hesitation.",
